<title>NEW ZEALAND: LWR sees rise in pre-tax annual profit.</title>
<headline>LWR sees rise in pre-tax annual profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textiles group LWR Industries Ltd said on Wednesday it expected to beat last year's pre-tax annual result this year.</p>
<p>&quot;The directors are still expecting to exceed the pre-tax profit level of 1996 in the current fiscal year, which will require an improved second half profit result,&quot; LWR said.</p>
<p>It earlier reported a fall in net profit for the first half year to December 31 to NZ$3.50 million from $4.74 million, with pre-tax earnings sliding to NZ$5.3 million from $6.1 million.</p>
<p>LWR reported pre-tax profit of NZ$13.2 million and net profit of $10.29 million for the year to June 30, 1996.  </p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    7.2 vs 9.7</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    6.0 vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     70.38 vs 71.46</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 5.30 vs 6.09</p>
<p>    Tax				     1.80 vs 1.35</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   48.88 vs same</p>
